+        -> "invalid character '\u2019' (U+2019)"
+      * single-quoted dicts whose values contain apostrophes -- {'response':
+        'I'm glad'} -> "unterminated string literal" / "invalid syntax"
+    A parse failure here is silent: the caller substitutes a canned reply
+    carrying 0.0 reward, so the gym scores zero on a turn the simulator answered.
+
